  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements:<br /><strong>Statement I: </strong>Ethane at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>333</mn></math>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>343</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;atm&nbsp;pressure in the presence of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>AlEt</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>TiCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;undergoes addition polymerization&nbsp;to give LDP.<br /><strong>Statement II: </strong>Caprolactam at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>533</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>543</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&nbsp;through step growth polymerizes&nbsp;to give <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Nylon</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn></math>.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "tybgW",
      "text": "<strong>Statement I&nbsp;</strong>is<strong> </strong>false<strong>&nbsp;</strong>but<strong>&nbsp;Statement II&nbsp;</strong>is true",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "6M4do",
      "text": "<strong>Statement I&nbsp;</strong>is<strong>&nbsp;</strong>true<strong>&nbsp;</strong>but<strong>&nbsp;Statement II&nbsp;</strong>is false",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "8sXZe",
      "text": "Both&nbsp;<strong>Statement I </strong>and<strong>&nbsp;Statement II </strong>are true",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "R6TXO",
      "text": "Both&nbsp;<strong>Statement I </strong>and<strong>&nbsp;Statement II </strong>are false",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
